    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a freed thrall in <strong>Jarlshof, Shetland.</strong> With only a small boat and a handful of silver pennies, you must sail the harsh northern seas to <strong>Ireland</strong> and the <strong>Western Isles</strong>. With no map and only 60 days until winter closes the sea, every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade shrewdly, raid ruthlessly, and  make it home with silver in hand\u2026 <strong><i>or die trying.</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raid or Trade</strong> \u2013 Sack villages, plunder monasteries, or negotiate trade deals to survive and thrive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Unknown</strong> \u2013 Explore a hidden map turn-by-turn, revealing new towns, rivals, and opportunities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy with Bite</strong> \u2013 Dynamic supply and demand drives real scarcity. Cattle is currency, but silver is what the Vikings want.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP &amp; Solo Play</strong> \u2013 Compete online against other players or play offline against AI in short, high-stakes sessions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speak the Language</strong> \u2013 Use Irish, G\u00e0idhlig, or Manx to unlock better prices, secret quests, and faction respect.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Sea</strong> \u2013 Brave shifting weather, storm-lashed voyages, and a brutal 60-day seasonal timer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crew Management</strong> \u2013 Keep your raiders paid and loyal\u2014or risk mutiny at sea.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Decisions</strong> \u2013 Decide what to trade, who to trust, and when to strike. Every action has consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Na Gaill</i></strong> is a turn-based squad-level strategy game focused on exploration, economy, and survival\u2014set in an immersive Gaelic world. Fight, negotiate, or outmaneuver your rivals before the sea turns against you.</p>",
