Every action has consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Na Gaill</i></strong> is a turn-based squad-level strategy game focused on exploration, economy, and survival\u2014set in an immersive Gaelic world. Fight, negotiate, or outmaneuver your rivals before the sea turns against you.</p>",
    "short_description": "As a freed thrall in Jarlshof in Shetland, you have 60 days to make your fortune in Gaelic lands. Trade, raid, and fight to survive. Keep your crew loyal, speak Irish for better deals, and bring your wealth home\u2014before winter storms claim it all.",
